xplain Customer Email Sentiment Analysis using UiPath AI Center.

Answer:

Customer Email Sentiment Analysis is an application of UiPath 
AI Center where Machine Learning models classify customer emails
as Positive, Negative, or Neutral and help automate actions.

Working Procedure:

The UiPath robot retrieves customer emails.
The email content is sent to the deployed sentiment analysis ML model.
The ML model analyzes the text and predicts the sentiment.
The prediction result is returned to the UiPath workflow.
The robot performs actions based on the prediction.

Example:

Positive → Store as positive feedback.
Negative → Forward to customer support team.
Neutral → Store for routine processing.

Conclusion:
 UiPath AI Center reduces manual effort and enables intelligent email processing through sentiment analysis.

